My Key Takeaways
Spring Boot reduces configuration and speeds up development.
Spring Container creates and manages Beans.
Dependency Injection makes classes loosely coupled.
Constructor Injection is preferred over Setter Injection.
Controllers handle requests, Services contain business logic, and Repositories communicate with the database.